+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a transport compression codec: the `config/decisions/` directory that tracked such decisions was removed from the repository tree in commit `9c6982d` ("move decision config out of the tree") without any replacement record, so no codec is presently designated and none should be assumed until a new decision is recorded.
